  "summary": "Med-Tech Visions is the aesthetic associated with a certain style of digital scientific stock images.",
  "description": "Med-Tech Visions is the aesthetic associated with a certain style of digital scientific stock images. It is seen most commonly on the websites of both internet and print news sources whenever medical news is presented (but other area of sciences like math, computing and astrophysics may also have it). It can also be seen illustrating science magazines and the cover or editorials of biomedical journals. It usually presents a very slick, digital pseudo-CGI image of organs or cells. It is common to have one element highlighted in a different color.",
